@editeconomy

- @increasegrowth: Increase Economic Growth by 5%
- @decreasegrowth: Decrease Economic Growth by 5%
- @increaseinflation: Increase Inflation by 5%
- @decreaseinflation: Decrease Inflation by 5%
- @increasetariffs: Increase Tariffs by a point
- @decreasetariffs: Decrease Tariffs by a point
- @returnsandbox: Return To Sandbox Menu

@increasegrowth
go-to: editeconomy
on-arrival: {!
Q.economic_growth += 5;
!}

Increased economic growth by 5%.

@decreasegrowth
go-to: editeconomy
on-arrival: {!
Q.economic_growth -= 5;
!}

Decreased economic growth by 5%.

@increaseinflation
go-to: editeconomy
on-arrival: {!
Q.inflation += 5;
!}

Increased inflation by 5%.

@decreaseinflation
go-to: editeconomy
on-arrival: {!
Q.inflation -= 5;
!}

Decreased inflation by 5%.

@increasetariffs
go-to: editeconomy
on-arrival: {!
Q.tariffs += 1;
!}

Increased tariffs by a point.

@decreasetariffs
go-to: editeconomy
on-arrival: {!
Q.tariffs -= 1;
!}

Decreased tariffs by a point.

@editrelations

- @increasedemocratrel: Increase Relations With The Democrats
- @decreasedemocratsrel: Decrease Relations With The Democrats
