@editradical

- @add5radicaldissent: Add 5 Radical Dissent
- @100radicaldissent: Maximum Radical Dissent
- @subtract5radicaldissent: Remove 5 Radical Dissent
- @removeradicaldissent: Remove All Radical Dissent
- @add5radicalstrength: Add 5 Radical Strength
- @100radicalstrength: Maximum Radical Strength
- @subtract5radicalstrength: Remove 5 Radical Strength
- @removeradicalstrength: Remove Radical Strength
- @returnsandbox: Return To Sandbox Menu

@add5radicaldissent
go-to: editradical
on-arrival: {!
Q.radical_dissent += 5;
!}

Added 5 radical dissent.

@100radicaldissent
go-to: editradical
on-arrival: {!
Q.radical_dissent = 100;
!}

Maximised radical dissent.

@subtract5radicaldissent
go-to: editradical
on-arrival: {!
Q.radical_dissent -= 5;
!}

Reduced radical dissent by 5.

@removeradicaldissent
go-to: editradical
on-arrival: {!
Q.radical_dissent = 0;
!}

Removed all radical dissent.

@add5radicalstrength
go-to: editradical
on-arrival: {!
Q.radical_strength += 5;
