@editparamilitary

- @raiseUnion_Leaguestrength: Raise Union League Strength
- @lowerUnion_Leaguestrength: Lower Union League Strength
- @raiseUnion_Leaguemilitancy: Raise Union League Militancy
- @lowerUnion_Leaguemilitancy: Lower Union League Militancy
- @raisekkkstrength: Raise KKK Strength
- @lowerkkkstrength: Lower KKK Strength
- @raisekkkmilitancy: Raise KKK Militancy
- @lowerkkkmilitancy: Lower KKK Militancy
- @bankkk: Ban KKK
- @unbankkk: Unban KKK
- @returnsandbox: Return To Sandbox Menu

@raiseUnion_Leaguestrength
go-to: editparamilitary
on-arrival: {!
Q.Union_League_strength += 200;
!}

Raised Union League strength by 200.

@lowerUnion_Leaguestrength
go-to: editparamilitary
on-arrival: {!
Q.Union_League_strength -= 200;
!}

Lowered Union League strength by 200.

@raiseUnion_Leaguemilitancy
go-to: editparamilitary
on-arrival: {!
Q.Union_League_militancy += 0.15;
!}

Raised Union League militancy.

@lowerUnion_Leaguemilitancy
go-to: editparamilitary
on-arrival: {!
Q.Union_League_militancy -= 0.15;
!}

Lowered Union League militancy.

@raisekkkstrength
go-to: editparamilitary
on-arrival: {!
Q.kkk_strength += 200;
!}

Raised KKK strength by 200.

@lowerkkkstrength
go-to: editparamilitary
on-arrival: {!
Q.kkk_strength -= 200;
!}

Lowered KKK strength by 200.

@raisekkkmilitancy
go-to: editparamilitary
on-arrival: {!
Q.kkk_militancy += 0.15;
!}

Raised KKK militancy.

@lowerkkkmilitancy
go-to: editparamilitary
on-arrival: {!
Q.kkk_militancy -= 0.15;
!}

Lowered KKK militancy.

@bankkk
go-to: editparamilitary
view-if: sh_banned == 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.kkk_banned = 1;
!}

Banned the KKK.

@unbankkk
go-to: editparamilitary
view-if: sh_banned != 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.kkk_banned = 0;
!}

Unbanned the KKK.

